==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɹiːləʊdə(ɹ)/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who does not [[contribute]] or [[pay]] appropriately; one who gets a free ride, etc. without paying a fair share, usually [[athletic]].
# {{lb|en|UK|NZ|Canada|Scotland}} An individual who gets merchandise from the back of supermarket premises that is past its sell-by date.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|free rider}}
* {{l|en|mooch}}, {{l|en|moocher}}
* {{l|en|scrounger}}

